<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3017] Spark version specified in Dockerfile doesn&apos;t exist anymore</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3017</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The 3 Dockerfiles for building and configuring the image on the 3 supported types of Spark cluster currently are referencing Spark version 2.1.1 which is not available in the Apache mirror.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thus we should change the version to the current 2.1.2.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
